    "Name": "Gerrida F",
    "Details": "The F configuration of the Gerrida hovertank fills its turret with twelve Chemical Medium Lasers, backed by an ER Medium Laser, a Light TAG and a Laser AMS that intercepts incoming missiles. A Supercharger lets it boost its speed to bring the lasers into range, while an Angel ECM and a Bloodhound Probe give it powerful electronic warfare and detection capabilities.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Lamellor (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       225     70\n<b>Left</b>         180     70\n<b>Right</b>       180     70\n<b>Rear</b>        150     70\n<b>Turret</b>      200     70\n\n<b>Total</b>      935    350</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Distracting</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
